03bafc7 3x"}, "body": "Good evening.\n\nI found your artstyle to be very cute.\nI also really liked your Genshin and MahoIku drawings.\nYour original designs https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/118396009 https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/119765336 are also very lovely.\nI like Raiden Shogun, Yae Miko, Chiori and most recently Mizuki a lot.\nFor MahoIku, I remember being rather fond of Ruler's design a long time ago.\n\nCould I ask you to draw my OC in any way you would prefer?\nI cannot think of something in specific to ask for.\nMaybe Inazuma style clothes?\n\nI hope you can consider and accept my request.\nThank you very much.\n\n-\n\nこんばんは\n\nあなたのアートスタイルはとてもキュートだと思った。\nあなたの原神とまほいくの絵もとても気に入りました。\nあなたのオリジナルデザイン https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/118396009 https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/119765336 もとても素敵です。\n雷電将軍八重神子千織最近は夢見月瑞希が好きです\n私は雷電将軍、八重神子、千織、そして最近では夢見月瑞希が好きです\nまほいくについては、昔ルーラのデザインが割と好きだったのを覚えている。\n\n私の OC をあなたの好みの方法で描いてもらえますか?\n具体的に何をお願いすればよいのか思いつきません\n稲妻スタイルの服を着た彼女を描くとか？\n\n私のリクエストを検討し、受け入れてくれることを願っている\nありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1M_VssZFwekre9NQzP-SMgWu5n1Ax2gn_?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1233311, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "浅葱眞夜＠あそびいとのあさぎ", "screen_name": "funnylife1207", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1721095871453179904/tmJzqpoS.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1089817349618688000/1712477138/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 1851380, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "芝豆", "screen_name": "zektbach1006", "avatar_url